   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Int AIDS Society conference 2009, Cape Town</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Int AIDS Society conference 2009, Cape Town</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International AIDS Society (IAS) &#xE4;r en ideell org. med en vision om en global kraft av professionella som arbetar tillsammans f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rebygga, kontrollera och behandla HIV/AIDS. IAS arrangerar den 5:e IAS konferensen om hiv patogenes, behandling och f&#xF6;rebyggande och Sida st&#xF6;djer stipendier f&#xF6;r attm&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;ra att unga afrikaner yrkesverksamma inom HIV/AIDS omr&#xE5;det kan delta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International AIDS Society is a non-profit organisation with a vision of a worldwide force of professionals working to prevent, control &amp; treat HIV/AIDS. IAS meetings creates platforms for exchange of new knowledge and practices. IAS will arrange the 5th IAS Conf. on HIV pathogenesis, treatment &amp; prevention and Sida support scholarships to enable young African HIV/AIDS professionals to attend</narrative>
  </description>
